 src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/SQ4Me7.svg\" alt=\"Spirit\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reaper\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/3y4pr7.svg\" alt=\"Reaper\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/NH9FJV.svg\" alt=\"Experience Obelisk\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></div>",
